    <!-- Shape tool: Polygon. Survey src/Icons.jsx `polygon`, verbatim: the owner-approved
         934-unit artwork (a closed run with round vertex nubs) as ONE filled path inside the
         file's own transform, translate(-3.4572 -1.9089) scale(0.0267). It is a silhouette,
         not a 1.5-stroke line drawing like Rect/Ellipse/Line beside it — that is Survey's
         choice for this glyph and it is kept.
         WPF applies a TransformGroup's children in the order listed, which is the REVERSE of
         an SVG transform list: SVG's `translate(t) scale(s)` means scale first, so the
